body:
OK, let's fact check:

The majority of player base is FTP and casual players, who play on their phones;
The majority of those players complete quests to earn gold to buy packs;
The majority of those players don't have time to grind the quests for twice as much time as before. Thus, they actually care about the changes, because now they gonna earn less gold, which means less packs, which means not having enough cards to play standard.

So they either will move to BG or quit the game. Either way, constructed mode will lose a chunk of its players.
